# Keep the build context lean — exclude everything that doesn't influence
# `cargo build --bin dq`. Mirrors .gitignore-style globs.

target/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.openspec/
docs/
spikes/
tests/
**/tests/
**/snapshots/
*.md
*.bak
.DS_Store

# Keep README.md / LICENSE since the runtime stage may want them as labels
# or for `docker inspect` consumers. Re-include them explicitly.
!README.md
!LICENSE
